# ==========================================
# CityPulse Master Git Ignore (Professional)
# ==========================================

# --- Environment & Credentials (CRITICAL) ---
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/local.properties
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks
**/*.properties
**/auth_key.json

# --- Subfolders / Build Junk ---
**/node_modules/
**/build/
**/.dart_tool/
**/.flutter-plugins
**/.pub-cache/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/

# --- Large Binaries & Assets ---
**/shared/models/*.pt
**/shared/models/*.onnx
**/*.wav
**/*.mp4
**/*.exe

# --- OS / Logs ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
output.txt
